	(text "J2: mini-HDMI (Type C, XUNPU HDMI-201); symbol pin numbers follow the Type C pinout.\nRN1/RN2 270R TMDS series as on FRANK Mini; HPD/DDC/CEC not used.\nHDMI +5V (pin 18, net M_HV_5V): diode-OR of VBUS through D3 and VBUS_USB_F through D4 (both 1N5819WS),\nso it skips D1 on J6 power (~4.7 V); a powered sink cannot back-feed the board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
